  "description": "This property is temporary closed \n\nMontparnasse Observation Deck offers a unique, spectacular panoramic view! This unique view point, which overlooks Paris from a height of 200 meters, offers a360° view of the capital, with a stunning 25 miles of visibility on clear days .Day and night, enjoy a spectacular, breathtaking view of the City of Lights. Ideally located in the Montparnasse neighbourhood, this unique, central view point in Paris allows you to see all of the city's most famous attractions and monuments: the Eiffel Tower, the Louvre museum, the Arc de Triomphe, the familiar streets and rooftops... Two viewing levels: The 56th covered floor : a modern and comfortable space, with displays that help visitors better understand its history and its dynamism : exhibition about historic Paris, interactives terminals and panorama. Also, one site food and beverage options and souvenirs shop, - The outdoor terrace at 210 meters high which was designed to maximise the astonishing view of Paris. During the summer you can enjoy the unforgettable view from the Champagne bar* while sipping bubbly.",
